        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Xiaogan, Datong, Wuhan, Hubei, Shanxi, Inner Mongolia, Hebei, China\n- Topics: prefecture-level cities, geographic location, elevation, provincial relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Xiaogan is a prefecture-level city in east-central Hubei province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Xiaogan is about 60 km northwest of Wuhan, the provincial capital of Hubei.\n- Datong is a prefecture-level city in northern Shanxi province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Datong is located in a basin at an elevation of 1040 m.\n- Datong borders Inner Mongolia to the north and west and Hebei to the east.",
